{"assignees":[{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa","databaseId":12109493}],"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"### Background\n\nThe GitHub page shows a PR's `reviewDecision` (✓ / ✗ in the list, the REVIEW REQUIRED badge in the detail header) and the submitted `reviews`, but neither **who has been asked to review** (`reviewRequests`) nor **who is assigned** (`assignees`) appears anywhere. The `--json` field lists passed to `gh issue list` / `gh pr list` / `gh issue view` / `gh pr view` do not include those fields.\n\n### Proposal\n\n- Add `assignees` (issues and PRs) and `reviewRequests` (PRs) to the `--json` field lists.\n  - `reviewRequests` mixes users (`login`) and teams (`slug`). Teams are shown by `slug`, not `@org/slug`.\n- List rows: after the title (before the review badge / `[draft]`), list assignees in DarkGray as `@alice`. PR rows follow with the pending reviewers as `→ bob`.\n- Detail header (the badge line shared by issues and PRs): add `Assignees: alice, bob` / `Reviewers: carol, team-x`. People who already reviewed show up in `reviews`, so `reviewRequests` naturally holds only the reviewers who have not reviewed yet.\n- Long rows are truncated at the end (the list width does not change).\n\n### Scope\n\n- `src/github/domain/{client,types}.rs` — new fields (`#[serde(default)]` for older disk caches)\n- `src/github/panes/{issue_list,pr_list}.rs`, `panes/detail_view/view.rs` — rendering\n- `tape/fixtures/` — the `--json` arguments change, so re-record with `mise run fixtures:refresh` (assign someone and request a reviewer on a PR or issue first so the demo shows them)\n- README / docs/README.ja.md / the guide's views-github chapter — describe the new information\n\n### Notes\n\nStays read-only: vig never changes review requests or assignments.","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-11-04T04:13:57Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":207,"state":"CLOSED","title":"GitHub view: show requested reviewers and assignees on issues / PRs"}
